From: batocera <batocera@localhost>
Subject: 0007-batocera-steam-proton-paths.patch

Discover Batocera's system Steam install (Proton Experimental, etc.)
even when Lutris HOME is /userdata/saves/lutris.

--- a/lutris/util/steam/config.py
+++ b/lutris/util/steam/config.py
@@ -22,6 +22,9 @@
     "~/.var/app/com.valvesoftware.Steam/data/Steam",
     "/usr/share/steam",
     "/usr/local/share/steam",
+    # Batocera system Steam (Proton Experimental / Proton ARM64 live here)
+    "/userdata/system/.local/share/Steam",
+    "/userdata/system/steam",
 )
 STEAM_ACCOUNT_SETTING = "active_steam_account"
 
